Add messaging between loaded root threads

Independent conversations need to exchange work without depending on
Desktop tool availability.
Expose `saffron.send_message_to_thread` for roots loaded in the same
app-server process.
Start an idle destination or steer its active turn using Core admission,
while preserving its settings and attributing the sender from runtime.
Deliver the message as a standalone tool output, not user instructions.

Report whether the input started a turn or steered one.
Do not resume unloaded destinations or route across processes;
the host must load the destination before delivery.
Parent-owned agents continue to use their collaboration tools.
